This directory holds version-controlled benchmark recipe YAML files, one
per benchmark, per Section 5 of ../../docs/EVAL_SERVICE_PLAN.md ("The
standard recipe — we decide it, not the teams").

It is part of catalog/, bind-mounted read-only into the backend
container at /catalog (see ../../docker-compose.yml), and is loaded into
the `recipe` table by backend/app/services/catalog's generic loader via
backend/app/services/standards/repository.py.

Two standards are seeded today: ifeval-v1-instruct.yaml and
ifeval-v1-think.yaml.
